{
  "description": "Generic declarative physics-diagram renderer — a fixed roster of labeled points and shapes (field lines, ray paths, or circuit wiring) drawn once on a physics-canvas with no simulation tick. Shape/point vocabulary is entirely config-declared, so the same mechanism serves any static physics sketch. Standalone by default; behind a lab router set matchMode and it renders only when MODE_SELECTED matches.",
